iOS 27.3 will expand new <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/guide/iphone/iph878d77632/ios">StandBy</a> features first introduced on the iPhone Duo to all iPhone models compatible with the update, according to Apple.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2023/06/StandBy-iOS-17.jpg" alt="" width="1960" height="1102" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-898860" /><br/>
StandBy mode makes it easier to view information at a glance while your iPhone is placed on a charger and in a landscape position. It effectively turns an iPhone into a bedside clock with some extra details. On the iPhone Duo, StandBy also works when the device is folded like a book or a tent, even when it is not charging.<br/>
<br/>
The new StandBy features coming to the iPhone 11 and newer:<ul><li>Updated versions of the Analog and Digital Clock faces with more options to customize the color and complications on them</li><br/>
<li>An updated Photos face that lets users pick Shared Albums</li><br/>
<li>New faces, including Calendar and Weather</li><br/>
<li>The ability to create multiple versions of each type of face and swipe between them</li></ul>iOS 27.3 also introduces <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-safari/">vertical tabs in Safari</a>, reintroduces <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-health-app/">Apple's redesigned Health app</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-apple-intelligence-china-2/">enables some Apple Intelligence features in China</a>, and more.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/iPhone-Duo-StandBy-Weather.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1075482" /><br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/11/iPhone-Duo-StandBy-Calendar.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1075510" /><br/>
